cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference or implement the LITS contract, please cite it as below."
title: "LITS — open standard for national livestock identification & traceability"
abstract: >-
  An open, vendor-neutral API contract for a national livestock registry — animal identity,
  movement and health events. The contract, examples and conformance suite are licensed
  Apache-2.0. National instances (for example ZLITS, MLITS) and the conformance mark are
  trademarks; "LITS" is the common name of the category. The national herd data and the
  mandate belong to each State.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The LITS steward"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/retrocraftdevops/lits"
url: "https://lits.africa"
version: "1.6.0-draft"
keywords:
  - livestock traceability
  - livestock identification
  - national registry
  - animal health
  - movement permits
  - OpenAPI
  - Africa
